cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PDScope, please cite the paper."
title: "PDScope: Breaking the Prefill-Decode Seesaw for Memory-Bound MoE Inference"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nezha-Anonymous/PDScope"
url: "https://github.com/nezha-Anonymous/PDScope"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the PDScope execution engine and scheduler on top of
  the ktransformers CPU expert kernel: phase-adaptive cross-layer scheduling, resident
  CUDA-graph hot set, zero-copy asynchronous I/O, native decode dispatch, and the
  measurement harness behind the single-request numbers in this repository.
